# Folder structure (`src/components`)

Follow `Rules.md` → **Folder structure**. Do not place domain components in the root of `src/components/`.

| Folder | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `ui/` | shadcn primitives only — no business logic |
| `admin/layout/` | Admin shell: sidebar, header, nav, section cards |
| `admin/tables/` | Admin data tables + `data-table` helpers |
| `admin/account/` | Account create / expiry forms |
| `admin/banners/` | Banner manager |
| `member/` | Member portal UI (`/member/*`) |
| `auth/` | Login / register forms |
| `shared/` | Cross-cutting (theme, logo, date-picker) |
| `skeletons/` | Loading skeletons |

## Placement rules

- New admin feature → `components/admin/<subfolder>/`
- New member feature → `components/member/`
- Auth forms → `components/auth/`
- Used by both admin and member → `components/shared/`
- Import with `@/components/<domain>/...` — never resurrect flat root paths like `@/components/users-table`

URL map & legacy redirects: see `docs/ROUTING.md` (update that file whenever routes change).

Public export names follow domain (`MemberHeader`, `UsersTable`, `AuthLoginForm`, `AdminBannerManager`); paths follow folders.
